                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Great game! Simple, easy to pick up and play. It's a workout too. Prepare to do a ton of squats to catch those grounders, then pop back up to catch a fly ball.\n\nI didn't think a VR game could improve my hand/eye coordination, but I'm betting that someone practicing their grounders and fly balls could really benefit from playing this game.\n\nIt's not a game with 100 different modes, but it doesn't need it. Just go out there and catch some baseballs!",
